// Rule: [T1059.001][T1105] Romulus Clickfix - Clickfix Powershell URL Staging
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1059.001, T1105
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR
// Required telemetry: DeviceProcessEvents
// Purpose: Hunting query for clickfix powershell url staging, with evidence boundaries and target-environment validation requirements
// Logic: Evaluate DeviceProcessEvents for clickfix powershell url staging using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result proves that the published query conditions matched in DeviceProcessEvents; it is an investigative event, not a malicious verdict.
// A match does not prove: ClickFix delivery, payload retrieval, execution, C2, or compromise.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// ROMULUS ClickFix PowerShell URL staging
// Classification: Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium
// Platform: Microsoft Defender XDR Advanced Hunting
// Telemetry: DeviceProcessEvents
// A result identifies PowerShell with source-supported evasion switches plus a URL.
// It does not prove ClickFix delivery, payload retrieval, execution, C2, or compromise.
DeviceProcessEvents
| where FileName in~ ("powershell.exe", "pwsh.exe")
| where ProcessCommandLine has_any (
    "-NoProfile", "-nop",
    "-ExecutionPolicy Bypass", "-ep bypass",
    "-WindowStyle Hidden", "-w hidden"
)
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "http://"
    or ProcessCommandLine contains "https://"
| project Timestamp, DeviceName, AccountName, FileName, ProcessCommandLine,
          FolderPath, SHA1, InitiatingProcessFileName,
          InitiatingProcessCommandLine, InitiatingProcessFolderPath,
          InitiatingProcessAccountName, ReportId, DeviceId
| order by Timestamp desc
